  "summary": "<p>One year after President Donald J. Trump declared a crime emergency in the District of Columbia and unleashed the Make D.C. Safe and Beautiful Task Force, the results are undeniable. The nation’s capital is no longer a Democrat-run nightmare of murder and lawlessness. Violent predators, gangbangers, drug traffickers, and sex offenders have been removed from [&#8230;]</p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/08/one-year-later-president-trump-has-delivered-on-making-d-c-safe-again/\">One Year Later, President Trump Has Delivered on Making D.C. Safe Again</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
