 Orders\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__child-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__child-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/nominations-appointments/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Nominations &amp; Appointments\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNominations &amp; Appointments\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__child-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__child-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/presidential-memoranda/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Presidential Memoranda\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tPresidential Memoranda\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__child-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__child-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/proclamations/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Proclamations\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tProclamations\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/fact-sheets/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Fact Sheets\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tFact Sheets\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link is-current\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Releases\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tReleases\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/remarks/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Remarks\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tRemarks\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-item\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<a\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tclass=\"wp-block-whitehouse-topper-navigation__parent-link\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\thref=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/research/\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\taria-label=\"Research\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\tResearch\t\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</nav>\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p>One year after President Donald J. Trump <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/presidential-actions/2025/08/declaring-a-crime-emergency-in-the-district-of-columbia/\">declared</a> a crime emergency in the District of Columbia and <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/fact-sheets/2025/08/fact-sheet-president-donald-j-trump-declares-a-crime-emergency-to-restore-safety-in-the-district-of-columbia/\">unleashed</a> the Make D.C. Safe and Beautiful Task Force, the <a href=\"https://www.usmarshals.gov/news/press-release/make-dc-safe-and-beautiful-task-force-marks-one-year-of-relentless-action\">results</a> are undeniable.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>The nation’s capital is no longer a Democrat-run nightmare of murder and lawlessness. </strong><a href=\"https://www.foxnews.com/politics/trumps-dc-crime-operation-puts-safety-families-first-arrests-surge-past-1800-fbi-director\">Violent predators</a>, <a href=\"https://www.justice.gov/usao-dc/pr/twelfth-and-final-member-21st-and-vietnam-crew-sentenced-101-months-narcotics-weapons\">gangbangers</a>, <a href=\"https://www.justice.gov/usao-dc/pr/fbi-arrests-seven-alleged-members-dc-fentanyl-and-pcp-drug-trafficking-conspiracy\">drug traffickers</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/USMSHQ/posts/us-marshals-conducted-a-sex-offender-operation-as-part-of-the-makedcsafeagain-in/788442497100711/\">sex offenders</a> have been removed from the streets. Homeless encampments <a href=\"https://www.fox5dc.com/news/dc-concerns-grow-trump-moves-extend-federal-control-clear-homeless-encampments\">cleared</a>. Parks <a href=\"https://www.nps.gov/nama/learn/news/fountainwork.htm\">reclaimed</a>. Crime driven toward <a href=\"https://wjla.com/news/local/dc-homicide-crime-data-year-police-health-fbi-bowser-reduction-council-criminal-justice-report-security-initiatives-efforts\">historic lows</a>.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>The </strong><a href=\"https://safedc.gov/\"><strong>Task Force</strong></a> <strong>— an unprecedented partnership of more than 20 federal and local agencies, backed by the National Guard — has </strong><a href=\"https://www.usmarshals.gov/news/press-release/make-dc-safe-and-beautiful-task-force-marks-one-year-of-relentless-action\"><strong>delivered unrelenting enforcement</strong></a><strong>:</strong></p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Over 16,000 arrests</li>\n\n\n\n<li>35 homicide suspects locked up</li>\n\n\n\n<li>More than 100 known gangbangers removed</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Over 3,200 drug-related arrests</li>\n\n\n\n<li>Nearly 2,000 illegal firearms seized</li>\n\n\n\n<li>25 missing children returned home</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Under President Trump’s leadership, violent crime has been </strong><a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/07/crime-plummets-another-historic-low-under-president-trump/\"><strong>smashed</strong></a> <strong>to levels not seen in decades.</strong> Homicides have <a href=\"https://www.justice.gov/usao-dc/dc-safe-beautiful-task-force-0\">plunged</a>. Carjackings, robberies, and overall crime have <a href=\"https://mpdc.dc.gov/dailycrime\">dropped</a> sharply. What was once among America’s <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2025/08/fact-yes-d-c-crime-is-out-of-control/\">most dangerous cities</a> is now on a clear path to become the safest and most beautiful capital in the world.</p>\n\n\n\n<p>President Trump <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2025/08/president-trump-is-delivering-on-his-campaign-promise-to-make-d-c-safe-again/\">promised</a> to dismantle the rampant <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2025/08/fact-yes-d-c-crime-is-out-of-control/\">crime crisis</a> Democrats allowed to fester — and he kept that promise.</p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>One year later, the record is clear: President Trump made D.C. safe again.</strong></p>\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov/releases/2026/08/one-year-later-president-trump-has-delivered-on-making-d-c-safe-again/\">One Year Later, President Trump Has Delivered on Making D.C. Safe Again</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://www.whitehouse.gov\">The White House</a>.</p>",
